    datamartId: 'consumer',
    prompt: 'The revenue team wants to know which device platform has the highest premium conversion rate, to prioritise where to invest in premium feature development. Return device_os, total_users, premium_users, and premium_pct (rounded to 1 decimal), ordered by premium_pct descending.',
