    prompt: 'The operations team tracks month-over-month order volume to understand growth trends and plan staffing ramp-up. For each month in the dataset, return order_month (YYYY-MM), order_count, prev_month_count (the prior month\'s count), and mom_change (the difference). Include all statuses. Order chronologically.',
