    expectedRowCount: 15,
    hints: ['What does one row in your result represent? Your output needs 15 rows with columns: txn_id, account_id, amount, occurred_at.', 'A CTE (WITH clause) lets you name an intermediate result and reuse it. Identify which sub-result you need before the final SELECT.'],
