    prompt: 'The merchandising team needs a line-item view of every fulfilled order to reconcile inventory. Join users, orders, order_items, and products to produce one row per item in each completed order. Return the customer email, order id, order date, product name, category, and unit price. Exclude cancelled and returned orders.',
