    expectedRowCount: 3,
    hints: ['What does one row in your result represent? Your output needs 3 rows with columns: size_bucket, txn_count.', 'CASE WHEN ... THEN ... ELSE ... END works like if-else inside SQL. You can use it inside aggregate functions for conditional counts.'],
