    prompt: 'Operations wants a per-provider scorecard to identify scheduling risks. For each provider, return provider_id, name, specialty, total_appointments, completed_appointments (no_show=0), no_shows, and completion_rate (rounded to 1 decimal place). Order by completion_rate ascending to surface the highest-risk providers first.',
